Cgame crowd module
==================

cgame_crowd_avoidance.cpp/.h are a C++ port of the ORCA algorithm from the
RVO2 Library (Agent::computeNewVelocity, linearProgram1/2/3):

  RVO2 Library
  Copyright 2008 University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill
  Authors: Jur van den Berg, Stephen J. Guy, Jamie Snape, Ming C. Lin,
           Dinesh Manocha
  https://github.com/snape/RVO2
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE-RVO2.txt).

Changes from the original: 2D only, spatial-hash neighbour search instead of
the k-d tree, no obstacles, parallel per-agent evaluation on the engine's
WorkerThreadPool.

The MassEntity runtime and the population LOD are original implementations
(concept references only: Unreal Engine MassEntity, flecs/Unity DOTS archetype
ECS, abstract-herd simulation talks); no third-party code was copied.
